<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Appointment Confirmed | AceGuard RM Ltd</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f3f7fb;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Arial;color:#142238}.top{height:8px;background:#0b63ce}.wrap{max-width:650px;margin:8vh auto;padding:20px}.card{background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:42px;box-shadow:0 18px 55px rgba(18,42,70,.12);text-align:center}.check{width:72px;height:72px;margin:auto;border-radius:50%;background:#e7f8ef;color:#16834a;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:38px;font-weight:900}h1{color:#07172c;margin:22px 0 8px}p{color:#64748b;line-height:1.6}.details{text-align:left;background:#f6f9fc;border:1px solid #e2eaf2;border-radius:13px;padding:20px;margin:25px 0}.details div{padding:7px 0}.details b{display:inline-block;width:120px;color:#263b54}.ref{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace}.btn{display:inline-block;background:#0b63ce;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:9px;padding:12px 20px;font-weight:750}@media(max-width:520px){.card{padding:28px 20px}.details b{width:auto;display:block;margin-bottom:2px}}</style></head><body><div class="top"></div><main class="wrap"><div class="card"><div class="check">✓</div><h1>Appointment confirmed</h1><p>Thank you, {{ $booking->name }}. Your appointment with AceGuard has been reserved.</p><div class="details"><div><b>Appointment</b> {{ $booking->service }}</div><div><b>Date</b> {{ $booking->appointment_at->timezone('Europe/London')->format('l, j F Y') }}</div><div><b>Time</b> {{ $booking->appointment_at->timezone('Europe/London')->format('g:i A') }} (UK time)</div><div><b>Duration</b> {{ $booking->duration_minutes }} minutes</div><div><b>Reference</b> <span class="ref">{{ $booking->reference }}</span></div></div><p>AceGuard will use the contact details supplied with your booking to arrange the meeting details.</p><a class="btn" href="{{ route